<title>EGYPT: SQUASH-CAIRO TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-CAIRO TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results at the Al Ahram international squash tournament on Saturday night (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>5-Ahmed Barada (Egypt) beat 2-Rodney Eyles (Australia) 11-15 15-8 15-11 15-9.</p>
